hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1442","Abu Bakr said: In the news of Dawud bin Qais, on the authority of Iyadh, on the authority of Abu Sa`id, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace: “So when he completed his prayer And he greeted him, then he stood up and approached the people.” Abu Bakr said: I included it in its entirety after"
